# NG-1: per-sprite renders of the non-legacy pawn builds are intermediates;
# the committed artifact is the packed atlas (assets/generated/atlas/pawn_*,
# assets/metadata/atlas/pawn.yaml). Rebuild with make art + make atlas.
assets/generated/world/pawn/*_m_thin_*
assets/generated/world/pawn/*_m_heavy_*
assets/generated/world/pawn/*_f_thin_*
assets/generated/world/pawn/*_f_avg_*
assets/generated/world/pawn/*_f_heavy_*
assets/metadata/pawn/*_m_thin_*
assets/metadata/pawn/*_m_heavy_*
assets/metadata/pawn/*_f_thin_*
assets/metadata/pawn/*_f_avg_*
assets/metadata/pawn/*_f_heavy_*

# Archify delivery receipts hold this machine's absolute paths (docs/architecture/README.md)
docs/architecture/*.delivery.json
docs/architecture/*.receipt.json
docs/architecture/*.finalize-summary.json
